assurance('AQ-001','Swallowed reverts permit an entirely inactive invariant campaign',['M4-purchase-always-reverts'],[40,46],'All 9 invariants survived a valid-purchase-always-reverts mutant at 64 runs/depth64; audit_strict 16/depth64 also passed with zero handler reverts. Unit/fuzz/security selection killed it with59 failures. RaffleHandler.sol:61-72 catches purchase failures; many actions silently return; no minimum meaningful activity is proved.','Track independent attempted/successful/unexpected-failure counters; assert allowed actions succeed; seed terminal branches without requiring every random sequence to hit all branches.','A contract that rejects all valid purchases must fail a stateful campaign; successful cash/NFT/refund settlement and final exits must have measured witnesses.')
assurance('AQ-002','Owner-only handler calls mask authorization mutations',['M2-owner-check-removed'],[48,54],'The stateful handler pranks owner for redemption/refunds (RaffleHandler.sol:187-188,207-208), so removing winner owner guard survived all9 bounded invariants. Existing deterministic/fuzz/security tests killed it with3 failures. Two holder addresses do not provide adversarial caller coverage.','Generate outsider, former owner, approved operator, buyer and recipient independently; retain positive current-owner actions.','Unauthorized claim attempts must fail with complete state rollback; current bearer must still succeed.')
assurance('AQ-003','Deadline action prefilters hide rejection-boundary defects',['M3-request-deadline-inclusive'],[56,62],'Handler requestDraw prefilter at RaffleHandler.sol:115-126 and Echidna:67-75 never calls outside the valid window. >= to > mutation survived9 bounded invariants; deterministic selection killed it with3 failures.','Add invalid-action probes at boundary-1, boundary and boundary+1, with independently expected results.','At exact request deadline requestDraw must reject and refunds become eligible; invalid calls must reach production rather than no-op in the handler.')
assurance('AQ-004','Economic oracle is useful but short-run reachability and some ghosts are weak',['M1-fee-400'],[64,86],'Fee500->400bps survived64-run invariants but was killed at run120 in a512-run campaign and by9 unit/fuzz/security failures. Guided existing-oracle probe also killed it. Rate literals are independent; gross/payout ghosts partly copy contract getters/returns. Echidna actor/split gaps are source-reviewed, not mutation-tested.','Seed lifecycle states, count successful branches, measure token balance deltas independently and add exact per-beneficiary Echidna split checks.','Wrong fee allocation must be reached and rejected in each outcome; totals alone must not substitute for correct recipient shares.')
assurance('AQ-005','Python reference model does not restore lazy settlement after unauthorized redemption',[],[88,102],'current_protocol_model.py:166-177 mutates through settle_winner:155-163 before raising not-owner. Probe changed settlement_complete false->true, unsettled1e6->0 and sponsor/treasury/winner claims0->150k/50k/800k despite rejection. Solidity transaction rollback and the passing owner/operator unit test preserve state; this is not a production rollback defect.','Prevalidate or snapshot/restore modeled transactions; add full-state rollback comparison and actual differential contract execution if claiming differential assurance.','Every rejected modeled action must leave the entire state unchanged just as Solidity does.')
assurance('AQ-006','Historical mutation denominator contains stale definitions',['M-07','M-12','M-24','M-26','M-27','M-28','M-37','M-39','M-43','M-51','M-52'],[104,110],'11/52 historical mutation patterns have zero current-source matches; they are invalid definitions, not survivors/kills. Remaining41 uniquely match but were not compiled/executed here. Generic nonzero-exit classification can conflate infrastructure and assertion failures.','Validate exact current-source applicability first, retain full logs/diffs and classify compiler failure/tool failure/timeout separately from assertion kill.','Every claimed valid mutant must compile and have a documented semantic change; mutation score denominator must exclude invalid definitions.',priority='P2')
